#. あら、苗木君。
#. ご機嫌いかがですか？
msgctxt "0001 | CELES"
msgid "Ah, Makoto. How are you?"
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0002 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Celeste"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0003 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうしよう？
#. セレスさんと一緒に過ごそうか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I hang out with Celeste for a while?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. では、わたくしとギャンブルでもしますか？
msgctxt "0005 | CELES"
msgid "Would you like to play a game of chance with me?"
msgstr ""

#. うふふ、絞りとって差し上げますわよ。
msgctxt "0006 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I would be happy to empty your wallet and show it to\n"
"you."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>セレスさんから容赦なく絞り取られた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Celeste gave me the business...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>セレスさんと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Celeste and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Celeste a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
